(7355715, 1151194, 65858, '<td valign="top">Haha, nice parody!</td>', 'Haha, nice parody!', '2015-06-01 01:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355750, 1151438, 3216, '<td valign="top">That''s awesome Christophe, - Monkey Island is one of my fave!</td>', 'That''s awesome Christophe, - Monkey Island is one of my fave!', '2015-06-01 02:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355753, 1150716, 6519, '<td valign="top">Having multiple language/spelling mistakes in so very few words and on the COVER of a book is something I can''t forgive. I''d never buy that book, sorry.<br/> <br/>It is a pity, though, because I like your idea. I like the simplicity of it ( a lot). I could really imagine this as a book cover - minus the mistakes and minus the dust bunnies.</td>', 'Having multiple language/spelling mistakes in so very few words and on the COVER of a book is something I can''t forgive. I''d never buy that book, sorry. It is a pity, though, because I like your idea. I like the simplicity of it ( a lot). I could really imagine this as a book cover - minus the mistakes and minus the dust bunnies.', '2015-06-01 03:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355754, 1150904, 16106, '<td valign="top">If this is not Lydia, amazing job on the toad. If it is Lydia, fair job. Either way well executed and angling the book in the frame is a great idea.</td>', 'If this is not Lydia, amazing job on the toad. If it is Lydia, fair job. Either way well executed and angling the book in the frame is a great idea.', '2015-06-01 03:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355755, 1151405, 6519, '<td valign="top">I doubt I''d even give this book a second glance. The topic is obviously pretty grim. It has a single short word on it - TRASH - and that word just sort of sits there (e.g. boring, flat font, nothing else). The image is a little dark, dull and certainly depressive. You are offering me nothing at all to pique my interest.<br/> <br/>I bet if this was a book, it may very well be a highly informative or even important one, but I''m afraid you lost me as your reader.<br/> <br/>Brave choice, and a pat on the back for that.</td>', 'I doubt I''d even give this book a second glance. The topic is obviously pretty grim. It has a single short word on it - TRASH - and that word just sort of sits there (e.g. boring, flat font, nothing else). The image is a little dark, dull and certainly depressive. You are offering me nothing at all to pique my interest. I bet if this was a book, it may very well be a highly informative or even important one, but I''m afraid you lost me as your reader. Brave choice, and a pat on the back for that.', '2015-06-01 03:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355756, 1151203, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am a HUGE fan of the "Earth''s Children" series, so I really, really wanted to love your book cover.<br/> <br/>Sadly, though, I can''t. It is very difficult to look at.<br/> <br/>I find that the photo itself is harsh (although the owl is a real stunner!), but then having so many different bits and pieces of font, in different colours, none of them standing out properly from the background all just add up to something I can''t enjoy viewing.<br/> <br/>I love the owl, I like the composition. Your choices of text (i.e. the words you used) were rather good - maybe with some different processing and a lot of font-tweaking this could turn into a great cover.</td>', 'I am a HUGE fan of the "Earth''s Children" series, so I really, really wanted to love your book cover. Sadly, though, I can''t. It is very difficult to look at. I find that the photo itself is harsh (although the owl is a real stunner!), but then having so many different bits and pieces of font, in different colours, none of them standing out properly from the background all just add up to something I can''t enjoy viewing. I love the owl, I like the composition. Your choices of text (i.e. the words you used) were rather good - maybe with some different processing and a lot of font-tweaking this could turn into a great cover.', '2015-06-01 03:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355757, 1151215, 6519, '<td valign="top">There is a lot that I like about this cover:<br/>The title (mostly the way it looks). The rest of the text (i.e. WHAT you chose to write). The font. The placement of the text. The overall colour scheme. The background picture/texture.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like is the way the image is just sort of plopped there. For once, I would really like to see a border and/or different placement and/or no image at all.<br/> <br/>That image just looks so out of place in an otherwise very pleasing book cover design.</td>', 'There is a lot that I like about this cover:The title (mostly the way it looks). The rest of the text (i.e. WHAT you chose to write). The font. The placement of the text. The overall colour scheme. The background picture/texture. What I don''t like is the way the image is just sort of plopped there. For once, I would really like to see a border and/or different placement and/or no image at all. That image just looks so out of place in an otherwise very pleasing book cover design.', '2015-06-01 03:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355780, 1151127, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, I can actually see this as a real book!</td>', 'This is excellent, I can actually see this as a real book!', '2015-06-01 06:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
