(7357438, 1151450, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing. If this was just an image, I wouldn''t care for it at all. As a book cover, it is interesting and unusual and certainly has me wondering what it is about.<br/>Not sure I''m digging the all capital letters in BURN.... I don''t quite see the point in that.</td>', 'Very intriguing. If this was just an image, I wouldn''t care for it at all. As a book cover, it is interesting and unusual and certainly has me wondering what it is about.Not sure I''m digging the all capital letters in BURN.... I don''t quite see the point in that.', '2015-06-05 03:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357440, 1151558, 6519, '<td valign="top">No title? No author? No text at all? I wish you had bothered to make the effort to make it look more like a book cover. As it is, it is just a rather "over cooked" image, the right text would have brought it all together and made it believable.</td>', 'No title? No author? No text at all? I wish you had bothered to make the effort to make it look more like a book cover. As it is, it is just a rather "over cooked" image, the right text would have brought it all together and made it believable.', '2015-06-05 03:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
