(7357693, 1151285, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of the hummers!  I''ve not seen them go after petunias, though.</td>', 'Very nice shot of the hummers!  I''ve not seen them go after petunias, though.', '2015-06-05 22:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357694, 1151005, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Cute idea, well executed.</td>', 'Ha!  Cute idea, well executed.', '2015-06-05 22:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357881, 1151029, 50695, '<td valign="top">She was a young equestrian who still thought life was an unfixed horse race. He was a cynical jockey trying to cash in before he retired. The ancient link between was unknown until circumstances drew them both into... the Red Tower...</td>', 'She was a young equestrian who still thought life was an unfixed horse race. He was a cynical jockey trying to cash in before he retired. The ancient link between was unknown until circumstances drew them both into... the Red Tower...', '2015-06-06 22:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357882, 1151566, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ducks of North America by Robertson is too far reaching to be a good survey. He spends far too much time on ducks that I consider to be South American. These wetbacks are just invaders who need to go back where they came from.</td>', 'Ducks of North America by Robertson is too far reaching to be a good survey. He spends far too much time on ducks that I consider to be South American. These wetbacks are just invaders who need to go back where they came from.', '2015-06-06 22:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357891, 1151541, 50695, '<td valign="top">Who knew diners had so much history? From the bloody Diner Wars that followed shortly after the Revolution, to the autocratic Dinersty of "Original Pete''s", you''ll find no shortage of drama on the menu.</td>', 'Who knew diners had so much history? From the bloody Diner Wars that followed shortly after the Revolution, to the autocratic Dinersty of "Original Pete''s", you''ll find no shortage of drama on the menu.', '2015-06-06 23:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357892, 1151191, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nabokov''s "lost" novel will break your heart as it blows your mind. The protagonist Neal Young (no relation) learns a terrible secret about his uncle during a chess tournament which he must win in order to afford the medical procedure he so desperately needs. In his final game, the pieces seem to be playing out his uncle''s story. But if that is true, then his King his doomed...</td>', 'Nabokov''s "lost" novel will break your heart as it blows your mind. The protagonist Neal Young (no relation) learns a terrible secret about his uncle during a chess tournament which he must win in order to afford the medical procedure he so desperately needs. In his final game, the pieces seem to be playing out his uncle''s story. But if that is true, then his King his doomed...', '2015-06-06 23:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357895, 1151203, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ayla, banished from her adopted Clan, must survive by herself. With only the help of a wise old bird, she ignores all the rules but her own and forms a Clan of One.</td>', 'Ayla, banished from her adopted Clan, must survive by herself. With only the help of a wise old bird, she ignores all the rules but her own and forms a Clan of One.', '2015-06-06 23:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357896, 1151519, 50695, '<td valign="top">Raymond Carver has really outdone himself in his latest collection of short stories, dictated to James Van Praagh from beyond the grave. The title story is written entirely in dog, so cat lovers might want to steer clear of this book. But for those of you whose bark is better than your bite, dig right in.</td>', 'Raymond Carver has really outdone himself in his latest collection of short stories, dictated to James Van Praagh from beyond the grave. The title story is written entirely in dog, so cat lovers might want to steer clear of this book. But for those of you whose bark is better than your bite, dig right in.', '2015-06-06 23:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357898, 1151546, 50695, '<td valign="top">Marla''s been a Packers fan her whole life, so why isn''t she happier to see Green Bay in the Super Bowl. It''s up to Nancy to find out what''s "gotten into" her... and it isn''t pretty.</td>', 'Marla''s been a Packers fan her whole life, so why isn''t she happier to see Green Bay in the Super Bowl. It''s up to Nancy to find out what''s "gotten into" her... and it isn''t pretty.', '2015-06-06 23:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357901, 1151077, 50695, '<td valign="top">Katie had everything going for her, and didn''t realize it until it was gone. Now she must start "Jersey Fresh" with her Aunt and Uncle in Rutherford, a couple who was determined never to have kids.</td>', 'Katie had everything going for her, and didn''t realize it until it was gone. Now she must start "Jersey Fresh" with her Aunt and Uncle in Rutherford, a couple who was determined never to have kids.', '2015-06-06 23:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357902, 1151288, 50695, '<td valign="top">In Bailey''s "sequel" to the Great Gatsby, we learn that Gatsby has faked his own death and now pretends to be a ghost haunting the New England coast in his Rolls Royce. I never thought Bailey could sink lower than his sequel to The Bell Jar, but he''s managed it somehow.</td>', 'In Bailey''s "sequel" to the Great Gatsby, we learn that Gatsby has faked his own death and now pretends to be a ghost haunting the New England coast in his Rolls Royce. I never thought Bailey could sink lower than his sequel to The Bell Jar, but he''s managed it somehow.', '2015-06-06 23:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357904, 1151228, 50695, '<td valign="top">Whether you''re "crafty" or just need some color in your life, this is the book for you. Martha Stewart''s gleeful instructions read like exuberant poetry. Think of flowers as metaphors and this book will have you dancing through life. Think of flowers as symbols and you will discover the secret to hidden treasures. Leave it to Martha.</td>', 'Whether you''re "crafty" or just need some color in your life, this is the book for you. Martha Stewart''s gleeful instructions read like exuberant poetry. Think of flowers as metaphors and this book will have you dancing through life. Think of flowers as symbols and you will discover the secret to hidden treasures. Leave it to Martha.', '2015-06-06 23:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357907, 1150682, 50695, '<td valign="top">Joan Green''s life changed with a single phone call. In a single moment, her life became empty. A year later, through an asylum window, she sees a boy she doesn''t recognize, yet seems familiar. What is he carrying? She can''t quite make it out... and for the first time since she arrived, she feels the desire to leave her room.</td>', 'Joan Green''s life changed with a single phone call. In a single moment, her life became empty. A year later, through an asylum window, she sees a boy she doesn''t recognize, yet seems familiar. What is he carrying? She can''t quite make it out... and for the first time since she arrived, she feels the desire to leave her room.', '2015-06-06 23:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357908, 1150812, 50695, '<td valign="top">Don''t let the cover fool you. This book is for adults *ONLY* and only for very very very lonely adults... but if the meat fits, poke it!</td>', 'Don''t let the cover fool you. This book is for adults *ONLY* and only for very very very lonely adults... but if the meat fits, poke it!', '2015-06-06 23:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357910, 1150839, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ms. Chovie will tell you everything you need to know to start your own reef aquarium. I was suspicious at first of some of her suggested fish combinations, but I quickly changed my mind when I saw the savage beauty of Darwinism in action!</td>', 'Ms. Chovie will tell you everything you need to know to start your own reef aquarium. I was suspicious at first of some of her suggested fish combinations, but I quickly changed my mind when I saw the savage beauty of Darwinism in action!', '2015-06-06 23:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357911, 1151461, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s opening night of Swan Lake. The curtain opens and out float the swans, until one of them collapses... the audience gasps at this cruel choreography, but then they realize that art imitates death, and the Bolshoi Murders have begun!</td>', 'It''s opening night of Swan Lake. The curtain opens and out float the swans, until one of them collapses... the audience gasps at this cruel choreography, but then they realize that art imitates death, and the Bolshoi Murders have begun!', '2015-06-06 23:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357912, 1151281, 50695, '<td valign="top">This book is simply not practical enough. It spends way too much time talking about Emperor Nasa Tang of the Tang Dynasty... I don''t think this guy even existed, and I know he didn''t invent poetry, so really I don''t know what these guys are thinking. They don''t even tell you where to park.</td>', 'This book is simply not practical enough. It spends way too much time talking about Emperor Nasa Tang of the Tang Dynasty... I don''t think this guy even existed, and I know he didn''t invent poetry, so really I don''t know what these guys are thinking. They don''t even tell you where to park.', '2015-06-06 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357913, 1151355, 136989, '<td valign="top">I love the way the blurred activity of the cabs and pedestrians offsets the subject.  Very creative, colorful and well-designed. My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love the way the blurred activity of the cabs and pedestrians offsets the subject.  Very creative, colorful and well-designed. My favorite in this challenge.', '2015-06-07 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357944, 1151300, 30861, '<td valign="top">Makes ya sad, Margaret? But you''ll always have France :-)</td>', 'Makes ya sad, Margaret? But you''ll always have France :-)', '2015-06-07 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357946, 1151127, 30861, '<td valign="top">Been listening much, Jason?</td>', 'Been listening much, Jason?', '2015-06-07 10:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358002, 1151300, 50695, '<td valign="top">"Their loss," thought Kathy Wynn as she boarded the airplane. She would take her revolution elsewhere... but deep in the Eucalyptus of her mind, the koala kept chewing.</td>', '"Their loss," thought Kathy Wynn as she boarded the airplane. She would take her revolution elsewhere... but deep in the Eucalyptus of her mind, the koala kept chewing.', '2015-06-07 11:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358004, 1151215, 50695, '<td valign="top">Jared always hated war memorials. They seemed part of a cycle of glorification that would only lead to more death and more memorials. But he wasn''t here to celebrate or mourn the past. He was here because there was one death too many at this memorial, and he needed to find out why.</td>', 'Jared always hated war memorials. They seemed part of a cycle of glorification that would only lead to more death and more memorials. But he wasn''t here to celebrate or mourn the past. He was here because there was one death too many at this memorial, and he needed to find out why.', '2015-06-07 11:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358005, 1151279, 50695, '<td valign="top">Carol learned an important lesson. Just because the driver takes your ticket doesn''t mean he''s going to your destination.<br/> <br/>But maybe... just maybe...<br/> <br/>she learned this lesson too late.</td>', 'Carol learned an important lesson. Just because the driver takes your ticket doesn''t mean he''s going to your destination. But maybe... just maybe... she learned this lesson too late.', '2015-06-07 12:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358007, 1151527, 50695, '<td valign="top">When you''re being shot by a photographer, you don''t expect such a loud noise. But you look down at yourself and you don''t see any wound. You''re fine. For a moment you even think he''s still taking your picture, but then he says, "that was just my background shot. This one''s for you..."</td>', 'When you''re being shot by a photographer, you don''t expect such a loud noise. But you look down at yourself and you don''t see any wound. You''re fine. For a moment you even think he''s still taking your picture, but then he says, "that was just my background shot. This one''s for you..."', '2015-06-07 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358008, 1151212, 50695, '<td valign="top">I remember when dentistry was a true discipline. The goal of the dentist was simple health and hygiene and nothing more. Postmodernism is the worst thing that ever happened to dentistry in my humble opinion. I would never go to a dentist who bought this book. In fact, after reading Chapter 3, *Anything can be a "Tooth"* and Chapter 4, *All Tooth is Relative*, I may never go to any dentist ever again.</td>', 'I remember when dentistry was a true discipline. The goal of the dentist was simple health and hygiene and nothing more. Postmodernism is the worst thing that ever happened to dentistry in my humble opinion. I would never go to a dentist who bought this book. In fact, after reading Chapter 3, *Anything can be a "Tooth"* and Chapter 4, *All Tooth is Relative*, I may never go to any dentist ever again.', '2015-06-07 12:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358009, 1151079, 50695, '<td valign="top">With the Tenth Edition, we can finally see the influence of Texas on the "Essentials." In order to stay in the U.S. textbook market, they''ve added the "Intelligent Design" chapter, speculating that an all-powerful Michelangelo sculpted the continents in all their curvaceous glory. And the reason for volcanoes and earthquakes? Homosexuality, of course!</td>', 'With the Tenth Edition, we can finally see the influence of Texas on the "Essentials." In order to stay in the U.S. textbook market, they''ve added the "Intelligent Design" chapter, speculating that an all-powerful Michelangelo sculpted the continents in all their curvaceous glory. And the reason for volcanoes and earthquakes? Homosexuality, of course!', '2015-06-07 12:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358010, 1151224, 50695, '<td valign="top">An essential addition to your fake book collection, "The Guitar Case" will allow you to play tunes you never thought were possible, like "New York Taxi Horn," "Default iPhone Ringtone," and "Rain on a Tin Roof."</td>', 'An essential addition to your fake book collection, "The Guitar Case" will allow you to play tunes you never thought were possible, like "New York Taxi Horn," "Default iPhone Ringtone," and "Rain on a Tin Roof."', '2015-06-07 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358012, 1151341, 50695, '<td valign="top">Lila doesn''t like being woken up, and after a 100 year nap, she''s especially cranky, as the boys of Alpha Tau are about to find out...</td>', 'Lila doesn''t like being woken up, and after a 100 year nap, she''s especially cranky, as the boys of Alpha Tau are about to find out...', '2015-06-07 12:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358017, 1151067, 50695, '<td valign="top">Tross''s obsession with birds gets the better of him in his fifth avian novel. The open aggression of beak on beak action simply cannot deliver the same suspenseful terror of Hitchcock''s birds, who seemed always waiting... waiting... and the scene where Kim Jong Un cancels lunch so he can watch two mourning doves peck each other stretches believability beyond the breaking point.</td>', 'Tross''s obsession with birds gets the better of him in his fifth avian novel. The open aggression of beak on beak action simply cannot deliver the same suspenseful terror of Hitchcock''s birds, who seemed always waiting... waiting... and the scene where Kim Jong Un cancels lunch so he can watch two mourning doves peck each other stretches believability beyond the breaking point.', '2015-06-07 12:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358020, 1151558, 50695, '<td valign="top">A masterpiece of speculative fiction, this book imagines a scrapbook compiled by hyper-intelligent radioactive frogs, celebrating the violent self-destructive downfall of mankind.</td>', 'A masterpiece of speculative fiction, this book imagines a scrapbook compiled by hyper-intelligent radioactive frogs, celebrating the violent self-destructive downfall of mankind.', '2015-06-07 12:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358023, 1151485, 50695, '<td valign="top">Brothers... there is no deeper bond among boys or men... but what happens when your brother is not your brother and when all the pretenses that made him seem part of your family are stripped away by circumstance and prejudice? That''s when you must decide for yourself who he is to you, and in the process define who you are.</td>', 'Brothers... there is no deeper bond among boys or men... but what happens when your brother is not your brother and when all the pretenses that made him seem part of your family are stripped away by circumstance and prejudice? That''s when you must decide for yourself who he is to you, and in the process define who you are.', '2015-06-07 12:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358028, 1151282, 50695, '<td valign="top">Jack didn''t know a horse from a mule, but he knew he had to get out of town fast and make a living for the summer, so here he was at the Double X Dude Ranch, staring down a black horse.<br/> <br/>"Damn, these things are big...."</td>', 'Jack didn''t know a horse from a mule, but he knew he had to get out of town fast and make a living for the summer, so here he was at the Double X Dude Ranch, staring down a black horse. "Damn, these things are big...."', '2015-06-07 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358031, 1151523, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ms. Nuthatch doesn''t seem to understand how nests work, but you will find her book inspiring nonetheless, as she describes hundreds of delightful ways to waste an afternoon. I don''t quite believe her when she says that if you don''t call your children, they will eventually call you... but really... so what if they don''t?</td>', 'Ms. Nuthatch doesn''t seem to understand how nests work, but you will find her book inspiring nonetheless, as she describes hundreds of delightful ways to waste an afternoon. I don''t quite believe her when she says that if you don''t call your children, they will eventually call you... but really... so what if they don''t?', '2015-06-07 12:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
