(7358085, 1150904, 50695, '<td valign="top">Most people reading this review won''t really have a choice in the matter, since this is a textbook, but let me just say that Biology ain''t what it used to be. Frankly, the "modern" biologist is a wimp. You can''t make an omelette without cutting stuff up, if you know what I mean. Dr. Victor Frankenstein accomplished more in a few months than these crybabies have done in years. The best use of this book is to drop it on your specimen before you cut it up. How''s that for anesthesia?</td>', 'Most people reading this review won''t really have a choice in the matter, since this is a textbook, but let me just say that Biology ain''t what it used to be. Frankly, the "modern" biologist is a wimp. You can''t make an omelette without cutting stuff up, if you know what I mean. Dr. Victor Frankenstein accomplished more in a few months than these crybabies have done in years. The best use of this book is to drop it on your specimen before you cut it up. How''s that for anesthesia?', '2015-06-07 16:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
