(7358269, 1150959, 50695, '<td valign="top">In a tour de force of fusion cookbook writing, Anonymous has provided recipes for the heavens of 50 different religions. The Nirvana cream cup, while impossible to make, is a joy to read about. And the Olympian Nectar Cake, mmm mmm mmmmmmm, go steal me some of that Panna Cotta, Prometheus!!</td>', 'In a tour de force of fusion cookbook writing, Anonymous has provided recipes for the heavens of 50 different religions. The Nirvana cream cup, while impossible to make, is a joy to read about. And the Olympian Nectar Cake, mmm mmm mmmmmmm, go steal me some of that Panna Cotta, Prometheus!!', '2015-06-07 22:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358272, 1151132, 50695, '<td valign="top">This memoir by an Alzheimer''s patient is the most beautiful, frustrating, heartbreaking book I''ve ever read. Don''t read this expecting a typical autobiography. The story has been robbed from us, just like it''s been robbed from the author. What we have instead is a lament, and a life diffracted into fragments by a lonely diamond.</td>', 'This memoir by an Alzheimer''s patient is the most beautiful, frustrating, heartbreaking book I''ve ever read. Don''t read this expecting a typical autobiography. The story has been robbed from us, just like it''s been robbed from the author. What we have instead is a lament, and a life diffracted into fragments by a lonely diamond.', '2015-06-07 22:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
