(7358414, 1151341, 150277, '<td valign="top">Worked well as a book cover for me, although not the kind of book or image that I particularly enjoy.  But great creativity, and very believable to me.</td>', 'Worked well as a book cover for me, although not the kind of book or image that I particularly enjoy.  But great creativity, and very believable to me.', '2015-06-08 00:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
