(7358896, 1151341, 114969, '<td valign="top">So impressive, it just looks like the real thing! Everything is great: lighting, colors, pose, processing, fonts. I wouldn''t be surprised if you received offers from real writers to use it :)</td>', 'So impressive, it just looks like the real thing! Everything is great: lighting, colors, pose, processing, fonts. I wouldn''t be surprised if you received offers from real writers to use it :)', '2015-06-08 13:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358905, 1151239, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon, I love your creation. It sure does look professional. Also the muted tones works wonder here, and give just the touch of mystery that would me open the book.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon, I love your creation. It sure does look professional. Also the muted tones works wonder here, and give just the touch of mystery that would me open the book.', '2015-06-08 13:56:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358907, 1151523, 114969, '<td valign="top">Fantastic one Mary Ann. The texture and colors are absolutely wonderful, and are perfect with the silhouettes. You just proved that creating a very intense mood doesn''t require a gazillion of items: a few ones cleverly used are so very efficient. Inspirational. Thank you!</td>', 'Fantastic one Mary Ann. The texture and colors are absolutely wonderful, and are perfect with the silhouettes. You just proved that creating a very intense mood doesn''t require a gazillion of items: a few ones cleverly used are so very efficient. Inspirational. Thank you!', '2015-06-08 13:58:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358909, 1150942, 114969, '<td valign="top">A perfect example of use of the expert rules, just a few subtle rays of light make for an incredibly beautiful macro shot! Congrats on the nice finish.</td>', 'A perfect example of use of the expert rules, just a few subtle rays of light make for an incredibly beautiful macro shot! Congrats on the nice finish.', '2015-06-08 14:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358913, 1151127, 114969, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, displacement maps ftw! Great example of how to properly use that tool, and very nice lighting as well. Congrats on the nice finish :)</td>', 'Oh yes, displacement maps ftw! Great example of how to properly use that tool, and very nice lighting as well. Congrats on the nice finish :)', '2015-06-08 14:05:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358915, 1151099, 114969, '<td valign="top">So full of poetry. I love it all, and the pastel colors are especially gorgeous. I''ll probably come back several times in the future to look again at your photo and get inspiration from it. Thanks and congrats on the nice finish.</td>', 'So full of poetry. I love it all, and the pastel colors are especially gorgeous. I''ll probably come back several times in the future to look again at your photo and get inspiration from it. Thanks and congrats on the nice finish.', '2015-06-08 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
